        "title": "A partner program for services and software",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Partners help customers plan migrations, build reliable projects and get more value from the platform.",
          "Whether you deliver services or build a product that integrates with Lattice, the program gives you training, technical support and a direct line to our teams. We work with partners of every size, from boutique consultancies to global system integrators, in every region."
        ],
        "items": [
          {
            "title": "Training and enablement",
            "body": "Free access to courses, certification vouchers and partner-only workshops that keep your team current with each new release of the platform.",
            "icon": {
              "assetRole": "icon.feature",
              "alt": "",
              "ref": "/assets/pages/icons/book.svg"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Go-to-market support",
            "body": "Joint marketing, listing in the partner directory and co-selling with our account teams on opportunities where your expertise fits best.",
            "icon": {
              "assetRole": "icon.feature",
              "alt": "",
              "ref": "/assets/pages/icons/target.svg"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Technical integration",
            "body": "Sandbox accounts, early access to new APIs and a dedicated partner engineer to help you design and test a solid integration.",
            "icon": {
              "assetRole": "icon.feature",
              "alt": "",
              "ref": "/assets/pages/icons/plug.svg"
            }
          }
        ]
